abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.1.1 is a backward-compatible patch release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It republishes the 7.1.0 package surface with refreshed package README content and carries documentation, validation, and test maintenance completed since 7.1.0, without public API, runtime behavior, or package dependency changes. Package IDs, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 7.0.0.0 remain unchanged."
